    },
    {
      "id": "0b6b1427d1e8",
      "source": "Most parameters in Embergen can be controlled by an external modulation node.",
      "target": "大多数参数都可以由外部调制节点控制。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "03beb1ea7ca9",
      "source": "How to modulate a parameter",
      "target": "如何调制参数",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d570573133b4",
      "source": "Let’s say we want a sphere to continuously move up and down. This can be done by hand using keyframes, but you can also use an ",
      "target": "假设我们想让球体持续上下移动。这可以用关键帧手动完成，但也可以使用 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "78005cff44be",
      "source": "Mod: Oscillator",
      "target": "Mod: Oscillator",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ea2d9c62ae7",
      "source": " node.",
      "target": " 节点。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "78037c7cb025",
      "source": "Set the override state for the ",
      "target": "将 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
