    },
    {
      "id": "1777bcc4f70e",
      "source": " to None so only the Z-position will oscillate.",
      "target": " 设置为 None，这样只有 Z 位置会振荡。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d97515af5c2a",
      "source": "Adjust the settings in the oscillator node to your liking.",
      "target": "根据需要调整 Oscillator 节点中的设置。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
