      "source": " value the highest.",
      "target": " 值是最高值。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c646ea099e7b",
      "source": "For example, when using a default sine wave the parameter value will oscillate smoothly up and down within the value range set by the range slider. Here, the ",
      "target": "例如，使用默认正弦波时，参数值会在范围滑块设定的值域内平滑上下振荡。这里，",
