    },
    {
      "id": "6ce54b449a70",
      "source": " This dropdown menu holds the different types of waveforms which will determine the pattern in which the values oscillate.",
      "target": " 此下拉菜单包含不同类型的波形，它们决定数值振荡的模式。",
