      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c2624bd5721f",
      "source": " Offset the values. Adding or subtracting.",
      "target": " 偏移数值，可以增加或减少。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ed6945c2d37e",
      "source": "Frequency:",
      "target": "Frequency：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cb3624b0cc15",
      "source": " Number of times per second the pattern is repeated. Higher values will make the values change faster.",
      "target": " 图案每秒重复的次数。值越高，数值变化越快。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4c49141d2515",
