      "target": "Phase：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c134e81fd88e",
      "source": " Temporal offset of the waveform.",
      "target": " 波形的时间偏移。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c0a04f880f8c",
      "source": "Amount:",
      "target": "Amount：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a0af622bf156",
      "source": " Intensity of the waveform. Higher values will have the oscillated values deviate further from the base.",
      "target": " 波形强度。值越高，振荡后的数值偏离基础值越远。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e171274640fe",
      "source": "Attenuation:",
      "target": "Attenuation：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ea5a925d162e",
      "source": " Intensity multiplier for all the waveforms.",
      "target": " 所有波形的强度乘数。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5ab2a46116ed",
      "source": "Other Modulators",
      "target": "其他调制器",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ae3af3915145",
      "source": "All the modulator nodes work with three values to represent the ",
